Hi everyone,

We're very excited to finally have you play our biggest patch ever - the "Director's Cut" update!

**Major Features**
- Full Controller Support;
- New Game+ and NewGame++;
- New "Mecha Fight" system;
- New Difficulty: Heroic;
- Gameplay and difficulty rebalancing;
- Performance improvements and bug fixes;

If you want to help us test it and squash some more bugs before the patch goes live to everyone else, please follow the instructions below:

[img]http://cdn.edgecast.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/clans/7040097/e6714460f62f60774d9d1800c6d88ee746e82d7b.jpg[/img]

1. Right-click "Chroma Squad" in your Steam library;
2. Select "Properties";
3. On the new window that will appear, click the small arrow where it reads "default" and change it to "public-beta";
4. Close the window and wait for the update to download;

Please note that this *Beta version is Windows-only* at the moment!

Also, please report bugs using the in-game tool. It is located at the top-right corner of your screen!

Also, rest assured that this update will be completely free to everyone :)

Thanks a lot for all the love <3

_o\  \o\  |o|  /o/  /o_

~Mark and the Chroma Squad team

**UPDATE**: Known issues for the patch:
- The game crashes when you leave it;
- Enemy info is not appearing during battle;

